{"title": "Myrmidon", "pageid": 27353, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Myrmidon", "categories": ["Creatures", "Races", "Non-playable races"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Portrait_Air_Myrmidon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/f/f4/Portrait_Air_Myrmidon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"152\" height=\"152\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f4/Portrait_Air_Myrmidon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption><div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">  Portrait of an Air Myrmidon  </div></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Myrmidons</b> are a type of <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental\" title=\"Elemental\">elemental</a> creature in <i><a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a></i> that are available to be transformed into via <a href=\"/wiki/Combat_Wild_Shape\" title=\"Combat Wild Shape\">Combat Wild Shape</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Elemental\" title=\"Conjure Elemental\">Conjure Elemental</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"About_myrmidons\">About myrmidons</span></h2>\n<p>Myrmidons are elementals bound in armour. They have immunity to poison, and resistance to slashing, piercing and bludgeoning damage. Myrmidons are <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Permanently_Armed\" title=\"Permanently Armed\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp/25px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp/38px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp/50px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Permanently Armed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp/25px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Permanently_Armed\" title=\"Permanently Armed\">Permanently Armed</a>, and as such cannot be disarmed. Air, fire and water myrmidons are also <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ethereal\" title=\"Ethereal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Generic_Ethereal_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Ethereal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Generic_Ethereal_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Ethereal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Generic_Ethereal_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Ethereal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ethereal\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Generic_Ethereal_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Ethereal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Generic_Ethereal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ethereal\" title=\"Ethereal\">Ethereal</a> so they cannot be <a href=\"/wiki/Shove\" title=\"Shove\">shoved</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">thrown</a> or used as an <a href=\"/wiki/Improvised_Melee_Weapon\" title=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\">Improvised Melee Weapon</a>.\n</p><p>Myrmidons can be transformed into by druids, or summoned by wizards, bards and druids. They can be found in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Wyrmway\" title=\"The Wyrmway\">The Wyrmway</a>, and during combat with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lorroakan\" title=\"Lorroakan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Lorroakan.png/25px-Portrait_Lorroakan.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Lorroakan.png/38px-Portrait_Lorroakan.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Lorroakan.png/50px-Portrait_Lorroakan.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lorroakan\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Lorroakan.png/25px-Portrait_Lorroakan.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Portrait_Lorroakan.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lorroakan\" title=\"Lorroakan\">Lorroakan</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ansur\" title=\"Ansur\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Ansur.png/25px-Portrait_Ansur.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Ansur.png/38px-Portrait_Ansur.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Ansur.png/50px-Portrait_Ansur.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ansur\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Ansur.png/25px-Portrait_Ansur.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Portrait_Ansur.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ansur\" title=\"Ansur\">Ansur</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Myrmidon_enemy_variants\">Myrmidon enemy variants</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Air_Myrmidon\" title=\"Air Myrmidon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Portrait_Air_Myrmidon.png/25px-Portrait_Air_Myrmidon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f4/Portrait_Air_Myrmidon.png/38px-Portrait_Air_Myrmidon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f4/Portrait_Air_Myrmidon.png/50px-Portrait_Air_Myrmidon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Air Myrmidon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Portrait_Air_Myrmidon.png/25px-Portrait_Air_Myrmidon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f4/Portrait_Air_Myrmidon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Air_Myrmidon\" title=\"Air Myrmidon\">Air Myrmidon</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Earth_Myrmidon\" title=\"Earth Myrmidon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Earth_Myrmidon.png/25px-Portrait_Earth_Myrmidon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Earth_Myrmidon.png/38px-Portrait_Earth_Myrmidon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Earth_Myrmidon.png/50px-Portrait_Earth_Myrmidon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Earth Myrmidon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Earth_Myrmidon.png/25px-Portrait_Earth_Myrmidon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/77/Portrait_Earth_Myrmidon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Earth_Myrmidon\" title=\"Earth Myrmidon\">Earth Myrmidon</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Myrmidon\" title=\"Fire Myrmidon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Portrait_Fire_Myrmidon.png/25px-Portrait_Fire_Myrmidon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Portrait_Fire_Myrmidon.png/38px-Portrait_Fire_Myrmidon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Portrait_Fire_Myrmidon.png/50px-Portrait_Fire_Myrmidon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire Myrmidon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Portrait_Fire_Myrmidon.png/25px-Portrait_Fire_Myrmidon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" clas